# Google AI. geminiweb-pa serves Gemini in Chrome; robinfrontend-pa and proactivebackend-pa serve the Gemini app on Android. Code Assist and Antigravity call cloudcode-pa through prefixed sibling hosts such as daily-cloudcode-pa, which a suffix cannot reach, so it is a keyword.
DOMAIN,ai.google.dev
DOMAIN,jules.google.com
DOMAIN,antigravity.google
DOMAIN,aicode.googleapis.com
DOMAIN,appsgenaiserver-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,antigravity-cli-auto-updater
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,labs.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gemini.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gemini.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,aistudio.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,notebooklm.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,notebooklm.google.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,deepmind.google
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,generativelanguage.googleapis.com
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,cloudcode-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,geminiweb-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,robinfrontend-pa.googleapis.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,proactivebackend-pa.googleapis.com

# Meta AI
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,meta.ai
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,metaaivm.com

# GitHub. Copilot's model endpoint is githubcopilot.com; api.github.com is ordinary GitHub API traffic and lives in config/Surge/GitHub/GitHub.list.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,githubcopilot.com

# Copilot
DOMAIN,copilot.microsoft.com

# Raycast. The suffix covers the whole product deliberately: its AI and dictation endpoints need a foreign exit, and so does the rest of it. AI attachments upload to an S3 bucket outside the suffix.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,raycast.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,raycast-releases.com
DOMAIN,raycast-ai-attachments.s3-accelerate.amazonaws.com

# Vercel
DOMAIN,ai-gateway.vercel.sh

# v0
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,v0.dev
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,v0.app

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,usemagpie.ai

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,modelpedia.dev
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,typesafe.ai
